### Notes for the reviewer

- The seed `EdgeTemplate` in the tests deliberately omits `LegacySuper` so a regression that adds it back fails `TestManageV2AllFilesAreV2Only` immediately.
- `chmod 0o555` test is `t.Skip`-friendly when the test runs as a user that bypasses Unix DAC (e.g. root in a container). It still passes under the project's CI image.
- The fixedPSKSource helper lets tests assert on exact PSKey values; production code paths use the random generator and rely on uniqueness via the per-AddPeer fresh allocation.
